WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:03.560
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:03.560
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:09.500
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:09.500
overflowing with love.

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:20.070
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:20.010
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:24.030
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:24.030
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.470
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.470
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.240
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.240
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.520
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.520
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:38.960
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:38.960
the red moon is watching,

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.550
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.550
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:50.010
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:50.010
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.080
I can say love

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:53.810
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:53.810
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.810
will you love me?

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:57.420
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:57.420
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.370
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:00.370
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.930
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.930
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:08.580
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:08.580
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:33.290
Docking system access complete.

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:34.990
Transmit the welcome code.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:38.920
Seina-kun, we're preparing to
dock, so you may want to sit down.

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.860
How big is this?

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:48.470
To put it simply, an entire solar system could easily fit inside it.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:49.670
Confirm code.

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:50.910
Confirmed.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.640
Code correct.

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:54.600
Please use the inter-connectors.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:56.510
E-Line on its way.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.420
Oh, Ryoko-san...

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:03.060
Cohen!

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:04.440
The E-Line!

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:05.690
Right!

00:02:11.660 --> 00:02:13.330
Connection successful. Bay doors open.

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:16.360
Engine output down.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.670
Clearance granted.
Now returning to port.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.640
It's over...

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.880
It's finally over...

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:30.390
You overexcited yourself when you
saw the space station, Seina-chan!

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.890
Well, this is the first time I've ever seen one.

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:33.850
Where's the station?

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:35.950
We'll be finished with our
docking procedures momentarily.

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:38.270
That's... the GP's...

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:56.980
Ryoko-sama is where it's at!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.950
You got that right!

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.060
Hey, don't drop that.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:01.000
I know, I know...

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.160
You moron! I told you
not to drop Ryoko-sama!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:07.300
I'll have to submit a report about
our encounter with Ryoko's ship.

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:11.030
It appears that you've
had emergency repairs made,

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.180
but you must have
taken quite a beating...

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.100
You're the new cadet, I presume?

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:20.140
I am Kuramitsu Minami, head of the GP.

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:22.730
I am currently overseeing the
repairs done on this dock.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.980
I-I'm Yamada Seina.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:25.880
Um...

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:26.950
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.320
It's my fault the ship was...

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:31.320
The crew is perfectly fine so you needn't worry.

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:32.290
B-But...

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:33.820
It's all right.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:36.580
Give us a single night and the
ship will be as good as new.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:37.520
More importantly, though...

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:38.560
Eep.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.100
Where do you think you're going?!

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:41.320
No!

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:43.500
Ouch!

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:46.670
I'm sorry, Father!

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:47.670
Father?

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:50.300
My daughter is in your debt.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:53.610
Daughter?

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:54.940
Father?

00:03:54.940 --> 00:03:56.940
I can see the resemblance.

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:58.180
Seina-kun!

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:00.290
Let's go take care of your immigration process.

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:00.930
Okay!

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:05.420
Tell him that there's no
need to worry about the ship.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:07.440
See you later, Seina-chan!

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:08.490
Okay!

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:10.030
Thank you very much!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:12.730
I'm coming!

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.000
What happened?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:15.870
Where does that hole go?

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:19.030
I believe it goes to the
lower-level control room...

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.070
Oh no...

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.930
Come and look!

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:41.470
This is a genuine photograph
 of <i>the</i> Ryoko Balouta!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.480
Ryoko-sama!

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.160
Too cool!

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:50.270
Sorry.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:51.400
Seina-kun.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:55.360
It was my fault that we attracted
Ryoko-san and all those pirates.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.210
That's okay.

00:04:57.210 --> 00:05:00.280
It is your gift, after all.

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.490
Would you like some bread?

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:06.160
They still haven't called our number.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.460
Does it look like it's
going to take a while?

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:11.530
We're a special case, so I'm not sure.

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:15.170
And the immigration procedures
will likely be difficult...

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:17.010
Do you mind if I make a phone call?

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.260
Kiriko-san...

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:22.710
I hope she's there today.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:23.740
Seina-kun!

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:24.730
Y-Yes?

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:31.820
Kiriko-san...

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.010
It's almost our turn.

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:38.030
Seina-kun!

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.830
Seina-kun, it's our turn soon.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.060
Hurry, if you could.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:45.200
R-Right.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:50.730
Hama Boroko's debut single,
"Fool on the Beach," on sale now!

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:52.800
Oh, the phone stopped.

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:54.210
Oh, Hama Boroko!

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.470
Immigration Inspector,
this is Yamada Seina-kun.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:01.680
Please check over this.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:09.560
Ki...

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.520
Kiriko-san!

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:18.530
Are you okay?

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:19.280
Kiriko-san!

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:25.220
Inspection complete.

00:06:25.220 --> 00:06:27.100
Immigration approved.

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:39.970
I'm glad you're all right, Seina-chan.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:42.180
Kiriko-san...

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:45.950
W-When I woke up, I was inside a spaceship,

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.090
and I tried to call you but
a bunch of pirates showed up,

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.190
and then...

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:50.100
Seina-chan.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:50.990
Yes?

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:53.310
Return to Earth right now.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.570
Seina-chan.

00:07:02.170 --> 00:07:06.160
Outer space is much more
dangerous than you think.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:09.310
Your life is in danger from the very moment you join the GP.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:12.750
You were attacked by pirates, 
so you should understand.

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:15.550
Please tell me you'll go back home.

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.500
Go live peacefully on Earth.

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:18.920
Um...

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.620
Sorry to interrupt at a moment like this,

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:26.260
but Seina-kun has been
granted special permission,

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:27.930
and his family has also approved...

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:29.350
You be quiet!

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:33.000
B-B-But Seina-kun is...

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.560
I knew you'd come!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.150
I'm here for immigration.

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.420
Oops... It isn't my turn yet.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:50.640
Bye.

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:54.420
Hey, pay attention.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.760
I had a feeling I'd see you again!

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:00.170
Did you come because you
wanted to see little ol' me?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.180
I heard you ran into some big
trouble on your way here, though.

00:08:03.460 --> 00:08:04.830
Y-Yeah...

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:08.270
Amane Kaunaq, 2nd-class Detective.

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:10.640
We're still in the middle
of the immigration process.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:11.840
The door's open though.

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:14.540
I'm in the middle of seeing what
Yamada Seina-kun wants to do!

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:17.510
What're you talking about? He came all
this way, don't tell him to just leave.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:18.550
Right, Seina?

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:19.950
Uh, um...

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:21.290
See? He agrees.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:22.650
Don't decide what he wants!

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:25.530
You don't know a thing about Yamada-kun!

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.250
Sure I do.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:30.490
He helped them catch a big
haul of pirates, didn't he?

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:33.500
He's as talented as
I thought he was...

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.620
I am sending Yamada-kun back to Earth!

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.050
Do you want to go back?

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.170
No, well, you see...

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:39.340
He says he doesn't wanna go back.

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:40.880
Stop making decisions for him!

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:43.270
The GP is too dangerous for him!

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:45.510
Are you sure you aren't the
one making decisions for him?

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:48.010
It sounds like he
doesn't want to go back!

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:50.750
Knock that off!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.640
Let go of Seina-chan this instant!

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:55.140
Seina-chan, eh?

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.020
W-What...

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.450
Don't worry, I won't take him from you.

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:01.270
I-It's not like that!

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:02.760
Then what's it like?

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:04.320
Stop changing the subject!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.820
Aren't you the one changing the subject?

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:11.100
That's quite enough of that, you two!

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:15.300
Masaki Kiriko, Amane Kaunaq,
and Yamada Seina-kun.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:16.820
The Chairwoman wishes to see you.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.870
You are ordered to come to her office.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:19.420
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.310
Oh man...

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:25.380
You're telling me...

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.020
Chairwoman Airi!

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:34.270
Galactic law prohibits bringing
people from primitive civilizations!

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:39.690
Furthermore, it is far too dangerous
to let such an unlucky boy join the GP!

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:43.230
His encounter with the pirates
is proof enough of this fact!

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.270
But don't you think
it's an amazing gift?

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:49.500
With a single ship, he found what the
entire Juraian Armada couldn't.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:52.710
And what would have happened had
the Juraian Armada not been there?!

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:56.370
Besides, it was your recklessness that put 
Seina-chan in that situation in the first place!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.040
Immigration Inspector Masaki!

00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.350
Please calm down.

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:01.130
This is not like you at all.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.630
Just as she said, it was reckless of you.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:09.220
It's just that I thought
I would see him again.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:12.140
What kind of reason is that?!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.160
But, how can I put this...

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:18.300
I saw his gift as soon as I met him,
and I didn't want to see it go to waste!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:21.150
So I figured he should enter the GP.

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:24.040
Well, let's leave it at that.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.270
By the way, Yamada Seina-kun...

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.530
What do you want to do?

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:28.940
Airi-sama!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:32.150
A number of exceptions to
that law have been allowed.

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:34.780
In fact, wasn't one such exception
made for another Earthling?

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:36.620
Yes, but...

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:40.820
In his case, he also
has his family's consent,

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:47.210
and Kamiki Seto Jurai has also
personally given me her recommendation.

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:50.930
So that leaves the rest
up to him, doesn't it?

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:53.550
What do you think?

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:55.810
Seina-chan...

00:10:59.110 --> 00:11:01.310
I... want to stay here.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:04.060
I realize that it's dangerous.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:07.110
But I want to stay here!

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:09.320
Very well.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:15.250
The Galactic Academy and the GP Academy officially approve Yamada Seina-kun's enlistment.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.090
I'm sorry. I...

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:21.660
We have to go take care of 
your enlistment procedures!

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:23.080
So, let's go!

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.320
Hey, wait!

00:11:24.570 --> 00:11:26.880
Principal Mikami, please cover for me!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:29.010
Wait!

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:34.300
Now, then...

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:55.210
Put her out of your mind for a while.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:56.410
But...

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:00.660
She won't hear you out right now,
no matter what you say to her.

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:03.330
The saying goes, "If you
can't push, then try pulling."

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.210
You don't want to seem overbearing.

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:08.460
Good afternoon, Chairwoman...

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:14.010
Now then, Amane Kaunaq.

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:17.060
The situation has
resolved itself this time,

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:19.460
but there is no question that
what you did was reckless.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:25.020
Therefore, it's been decided that your promotion to 1st-class Detective is postponed.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:26.570
W-What?!

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:29.070
Mikami-sensei, you can't be serious!

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:30.860
I am.

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:33.170
You will serve as an
instructor at the GP Academy

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:36.540
for the next six months while you
think over what you've done.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:38.660
Try your best, Amane-sensei.

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:42.570
Understood.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.880
Or would you prefer cleaning
restrooms with Mitoto?

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.960
I'm sorry!

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:53.210
What a character...

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:57.800
It's because you worry about him so
much that Seto-sama uses you for her fun.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.000
S-Sensei! I'm...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:05.770
I understand that you knew him from a very young age and care for him like a brother,

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:08.770
but he isn't going to
remain a child forever.

00:13:11.170 --> 00:13:14.990
You too will serve as a GP
instructor for a short while.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:19.240
But, Principal...

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:21.550
A message from Seto-sama.

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:23.750
"Work him hard and make him into a man."

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:27.580
Full of meaning, is it not?

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:32.610
It's normal for an Earthling to be surprised.

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:33.130
I'm sorry!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:35.720
No, don't worry about it.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.410
U-Um...

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:48.310
What is it?

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.920
Haven't we met somewhere before?

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:52.490
No, that's impossible, huh?

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:54.730
I've never met another species until now!

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.320
I'm free for a date anytime.{If you'd like to go on a date,
any time is fine with me!}

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:58.780
That's not...

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:00.620
Please excuse me.

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:03.700
You're pretty good, Seina-kun.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.200
I-It's not like that!

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:09.970
Maybe I should tell
Kiriko-chan about this!

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:11.470
N-No, it's not like that!

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:16.280
I-It was just that I thought I had
smelled her perfume somewhere before.

00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:18.930
Well, I'll let you off the hook for now.

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:23.810
Now then, let's hurry and get
your enrollment process over with...

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:25.650
Seina-kun!

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:33.060
You're done with the standard
examinations and procedures,

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:34.530
but I wonder what
we should do now?

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:35.800
What do you mean?

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:39.570
I'd like to show you around
the inside of the GP Academy,

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:42.670
but you'd probably be happier
having a young woman like Elma

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:47.240
be your guide instead of
an older lady like me, so...

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:47.680
Right?

00:14:47.680 --> 00:14:49.500
No, that's not true...

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:50.830
Oh, really?!

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:56.080
In that case, shall we take the deluxe tour of all the best, out of the way spots?

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.550
Oh, hold on a second.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.960
So you're Yamada Seina-dono?

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:09.480
Yes!

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.940
I despise Earthlings!

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:16.520
It seems you've achieved quite a bit
before becoming an official student,

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:19.240
but we cannot allow the GP
to be made a mockery of!

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:23.660
This place was not meant for
babysitting uncivilized Earthlings!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.350
Listen, Earth boy.

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:28.540
The GP is a finely crafted,
high level organization!

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:31.650
I don't know what sort of
misunderstanding you've made,

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:36.040
but go back to your uncivilized Earth
at once, you uncivilized-

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:39.880
Stop intimidating the
new students, you moron!

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:42.970
Airi-sama, I wasn't intimidating him.

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:46.810
I was simply informing him
of how strict the GP is.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.640
And what was that you
said about Earthlings?

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:50.770
Let me hear it again!

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:54.930
Oh my, I just remembered I have a class!

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:58.980
Well then, Seina-kun. I look
forward to seeing you in class!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.610
Excuse me.

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:02.390
Who's that?

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:03.550
He's kind of weird...

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:05.620
A GP Academy instructor.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:06.680
Instructor?

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:08.030
You mean he's a teacher?!

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:10.420
His name's Tennan Seiryo.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:13.030
He's a very talented member of the GP.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:16.970
At one time he was also a candidate
suitor for the Juraian Royal Family.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:20.500
He's on the border between being
a genius and being a lunatic.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:24.500
Things were fine while
he walked that fine line,

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.040
but then he lost to
Tenchi-chan in a duel,

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:30.210
and he's been proclaiming his
hatred for Earthlings ever since.

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.810
That was precisely what he did just now.

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.060
Tenchi-chan?

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.420
He's become a rather
interesting character.

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.060
Personally, I've taken a liking to him.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:41.120
Um, that's fine, but don't
tell me that Tenchi-chan is...

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:43.520
Of course I mean Masaki Tenchi-kun.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.450
Why did Tenchi-senpai...

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:46.860
Ready?

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:51.450
The child of Azusa-sama, the current king of Jurai, and his first wife Funaho was Yosho-dono.

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:53.960
He also happens to be my husband.

00:16:54.530 --> 00:17:00.430
Yosho-dono then ran into some trouble on Earth, and had a grandson: Tenchi-chan.

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:05.930
Incidentally, the mother of Azusa-sama's second wife, Misaki, is Seto-sama.

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:08.510
So now do you understand?

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:10.480
Let me see...

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:13.020
In other words, that
makes you Tenchi-senpai's...

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:14.230
grandmother?

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.590
Don't you ever call me that!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.350
Sorry!

00:17:17.920 --> 00:17:22.630
So Kiriko-san and Kai both have some
relationship to that Juraian family?

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:23.390
Yes.

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:26.300
Though Kai-kun probably hasn't
even the slightest inkling...

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:29.600
Oh, I'll warn you in advance,
but you can't let him know.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:34.210
Everyone else is looking forward to how they will break the news to him.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:35.580
I-Is that so?

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:38.290
Well then, shall we go put the
finishing touches on today?

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.040
Finishing touches?

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:49.180
Um, I think it's a little too big...

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:50.390
Here.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.590
It looks good on you.

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.770
You can change the size?

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:59.150
It not only looks good, but is comfortable, too!

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:01.870
The latest outfits are even better.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:06.870
Some can even generate special energy
fields around the wearer's body.

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:11.240
With a single program you can change
the color, design, and texture,

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:13.880
not to mention its sweat-absorption
properties or medical capabilities.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:17.580
Functionality-wise, I suppose it's quite
similar to riding in a large robot!

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:20.220
So it's sort of like a power suit!

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:25.690
But most people wear cotton clothes
similar to those you have on Earth.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:27.090
Even though these ones are so useful?

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:30.100
Just because something is useful
doesn't mean it's the best.

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:37.230
Just like with meals, cooked food
is far superior to nutrition tablets.

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:40.170
You can think of it as
enjoying inconvenience.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.540
Things can be pretty dull if you
prefer efficiency over all else.

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:46.680
Though fashions and trends come
and go depending on the times,

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:49.170
so I can't say that it's a universal rule.

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:53.450
Now I see why Kiriko-chan was so worried.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:02.190
Here I go!

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:06.770
Hello!

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:08.700
I just entered the academy!

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:09.600
My name is Yamada Seina-

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:15.240
Welcome, Seina!

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.600
I'm Kenneth Barl, but you can call me Kenneth.

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:19.820
I'm Rajau Ga Waura.

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:21.150
Pleased to meet you, Seina-kun!

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:22.820
P-Pleased to meet you.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:27.610
Oh yeah, they delivered your
luggage and your NB Reasoning Unit.

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:29.160
My NB... what?

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:30.610
Your NB Reasoning Unit.

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:33.870
It's an A.I. Robot that assists
you in all sorts of ways.

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:38.100
But I've never seen a
unit like this one before.

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:39.870
It looks like it's a test model.

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:43.750
It must be given specially to you since you're from a primitive civilization.

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:47.600
Seina-kun, could I borrow this later?

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:48.410
Go ahead.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:49.640
Thank you!

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:51.260
With this we just might be able to do it!

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:54.140
Well then, next up is
a tour of our dorm room!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:58.640
This sprays you with microscopic
nano-machines that clean you.

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:03.720
If you'd like to take a liquid bath,
there's a public bathhouse you can use.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:06.330
For the most part we use the bathhouse.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:10.460
But this can clean you with your clothes on, so it's good if you're in a hurry.

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:11.560
With your clothes on?!

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:13.540
Wanna give it a try?

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:17.100
First you lock the door like this, and then...

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:18.660
Laundry mode?!

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:23.210
Why did it go into laundry mode
while there were people inside?

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.280
The door locks itself automatically.

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:28.280
If you don't have a key, the door
will still open with your fingerprint.

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:31.480
So basically, if you ever find
yourself locked outside like this,

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:34.250
all you have to do is place
your finger on the door switch!

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:42.520
We're sorry!

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.190
Who would've thought
the door would break too?

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:48.940
It's such a simple system...

00:20:49.840 --> 00:20:50.750
I'm sorry.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:53.690
It was probably my fault.

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:58.450
It seems I have really bad luck,
and it affects people around me too...

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:03.180
So it might be best if I asked
them to change my room assignment.

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:04.340
I see.

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:06.960
So you're the kind of person
who lives thinking about probabilities.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:09.720
This should be interesting!

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.190
Don't worry about it.

00:21:11.190 --> 00:21:13.460
We couldn't live here if we gave up that easily.

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:14.560
Kenneth...

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:15.630
Rajau...

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:18.160
As its name suggests,

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:22.130
the Galactic Academy is where interesting people from all over the galaxy come together.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.470
Especially philosophers.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:25.640
Well, you'll catch on quick.

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:30.360
Basically, something like that isn't
enough to stop us from being friends.

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:33.030
Thanks!

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:35.030
Well, let's get something to eat.

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:38.740
Eat some food, it'll make you feel better.

00:21:39.420 --> 00:21:43.490
When you choose your food, 
it tells you what nutrients you're missing.

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:47.250
If it turns out you don't like it,
 you can switch it to a drink.

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:52.400
We can also order from outside
restaurants, but it costs lots of money.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:52.960
Here it is!

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:56.720
Let's eat!

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:06.850
Say, Seina, could you get
a different dorm room?

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:08.400
I told you.

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:21.690
uchuu de saitei saiaku

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:21.690
You're the worst, most hopeless,

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:26.810
un warui Unlucky Boy

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:26.810
most unlucky boy in space.

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:34.020
anna koto shite te mo

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:34.020
No matter what you do,

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:36.750
konna koto shite te mo

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:36.750
no matter what you do,

00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:41.540
otozureru jiko tensai sugoi wana

00:22:37.020 --> 00:22:41.540
you can't escape the accidents, disasters and traps

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:43.830
anata wa nigerarenai

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:43.830
that come your way.

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:47.400
keikai shite te mo

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:47.400
Even if your really careful...

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:50.110
ikinari shichatte mo

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:50.110
And even if you're not...

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:56.340
saitei saiaku dame dame no

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:56.340
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:22:56.340 --> 00:23:00.810
anata wa doshiyou mo nai

00:22:56.340 --> 00:23:00.810
You're a lost cause.

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:10.760
anata ga saitei saiaku

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:10.760
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:15.380
anata wa Unlucky Boy

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:15.380
You're an unlucky boy.

00:23:15.380 --> 00:23:20.460
dakedo anata shika mienai

00:23:15.380 --> 00:23:20.460
But all I can see is you,

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:25.980
sonna anata shika mienai

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:25.980
just the way you are.

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:33.920
Surrounded by my roommates
Kenneth and Rajau,

00:23:33.920 --> 00:23:36.090
my dorm life at the GP has begun.

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:38.750
Just when it looks like I'm
about to get on top of things...

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:41.660
What does "the night
is still young" mean?!

00:23:41.660 --> 00:23:43.630
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!
